{
  "name": "RAG Knowledge Base Chatbot (Drive + Qdrant + Telegram)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. INGESTION (Google Drive -> Qdrant)\nFile baru/diubah di folder Drive diproses otomatis.\n\n**Sebelum jalan:**\n- Ganti FOLDER_ID di kedua Drive Trigger\n- Ganti URL Qdrant di node 'Hapus Vektor Lama'\n- Pasang semua credentials\n\nSaat file diubah, vektor lama dihapus dulu (berdasar metadata.file_id) agar tidak duplikat.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "1369b562-198d-48f8-843b-2f2556d4d2df",
      "name": "Catatan Ingestion",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        4496,
        480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. CHATBOT (Telegram -> AI Agent + RAG)\n**Sebelum jalan:**\n- Ganti chat ID di node 'Cek Akses' (daftar user yang diizinkan)\n- n8n harus bisa diakses publik via HTTPS agar webhook Telegram berfungsi\n- Postgres untuk memori percakapan (tabel dibuat otomatis)",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "854e0d03-a4d8-4b7f-b00e-79823e569a07",
      "name": "Catatan Chat",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
